# seraph's mdss_mdp block sits at a different bus address than the one
# hardcoded in common/kernel/filesystem.te (ae00000.qcom,mdss_mdp), so
# power/control falls back to the default sysfs_t label there. Re-label
# it here for seraph's actual address so qseecomd's allow rule in
# device/qseecomd.te applies.
genfscon sysfs /devices/platform/soc/9800000.qcom,mdss_mdp/power/control gen_context(system_u:object_r:power_control_t,s0)
